「今日もラブレター渡せなかったな」え、恋愛だ、恋愛。
"Couldn't give him my love letter today either..." Oh, romance! It's romance!

221
00:15:41,731 --> 00:15:44,281
「風に乗って、あの人に届いてくれればいいのに…」
"If only it would ride the wind and reach him..."

222
00:15:44,481 --> 00:15:46,881
あ、わし風？もしかして。風担当ですか？
Ah, am I the wind, perhaps? Am I on wind duty?

223
00:15:47,281 --> 00:15:48,831
あっ、水たまり。
Ah, a puddle.

224
00:15:49,031 --> 00:15:52,031
頑張れ、頑張れ、頑張れ、頑張れ。
Hang in there, hang in there, go, go...

225
00:15:52,331 --> 00:15:53,881
いくよ、あの人、あの人！
Here it goes, to that guy, that guy!

226
00:15:53,981 --> 00:15:54,631
行け！
Go!

227
00:15:54,831 --> 00:15:56,031
あ、痛いって。
Ah, he said it hurt!

228
00:15:56,131 --> 00:15:56,831
え？
Huh?

229
00:15:58,031 --> 00:16:01,031
[Title: 第12問]
[Title: Question 12]

230
00:15:59,081 --> 00:16:00,131
今のだめ？
Was that bad?

231
