あっ、て、手元に？
Ah, to... to his hands?

232
00:16:04,231 --> 00:16:05,831
手元に届けて的な？
Like, deliver it right into his hands?

233
00:16:06,031 --> 00:16:06,831
行くよ！
Here goes!

234
00:16:06,881 --> 00:16:07,831
ジャンプ！
Jump!

235
00:16:08,131 --> 00:16:08,781
は？
Huh?

236
