プレイスキルやん！
That's just gamer skill!

238
00:16:12,681 --> 00:16:14,231
プレイスキルなのじゃ、これ！
This is all down to pure gaming skills!

239
00:16:14,781 --> 00:16:16,581
え、なんかヘッショ駄目だったっぽい。
Wait, so headshotting him was a no-go?

240
00:16:16,631 --> 00:16:19,331
面白い動画見つけたの、わぁ楽しみ！来た、面白い動画！
"Found a funny video!" "Yay, can't wait!" Here it is, the funny video!

241
00:16:20,031 --> 00:16:21,531
広告があるタイプ！
It's the kind with ads!

242
00:16:21,581 --> 00:16:23,031
ちょっ、飛ばそ、飛ばそ。
Wait, skip it, skip it!

243
00:16:23,131 --> 00:16:25,481
こ、YouTube Premium 入ろ？
Sh-Should we get YouTube Premium?

244
00:16:25,531 --> 00:16:26,781
あ、空気読み来た。
Ah, Kouki Yomi started.

245
00:16:27,531 --> 00:16:30,531
[Title: 第14問]
[Title: Question 14]

246
00:16:28,531 --> 00:16:31,031
広告って変なのいっぱい流れるよね。
Ads always show so many weird things, right?

247
