ちょっ、出しすぎたか？
Wait, did I click out too much?

259
00:17:00,681 --> 00:17:02,231
芯出しすぎて折る代わり…
Instead of clicking it out too much and snapping it...

260
00:17:01,531 --> 00:17:04,531
[Title: 途中経過]
[Title: Progress Check]

261
00:17:03,131 --> 00:17:04,731
