For these five questions...

262
00:17:05,731 --> 00:17:08,781
なんとはなしに…なんかさっきより駄目だったっぽい。
"Vaguely..." Looks like I did worse than before.

263
00:17:08,881 --> 00:17:10,231
なんかさー
I mean, look...

264
00:17:10,431 --> 00:17:12,931
ラブレター届ける奴あったじゃろ？
There was that love letter delivery one, right?

265
00:17:13,481 --> 00:17:16,581
ラブレター届けるのが下手くそだったっぽい。
Looks like I was just terrible at delivering the love letter.

266
00:17:17,431 --> 00:17:18,831
あの、手元？
Like, into his hands?

267
00:17:20,231 --> 00:17:22,481
え、何？じゃあ胸？胸にってこと？
Wait, what? Then his chest? You mean right at his chest?

268
00:17:22,831 --> 00:17:25,481
お腹とか胸にぶつければよかったってこと？
Does that mean I should've hit him in the stomach or chest?

269
00:17:26,981 --> 00:17:27,781
ん？
Hm?

270
00:17:28,731 --> 00:17:29,981
ヘッショが駄目？
No headshots?

271
00:17:30,431 --> 00:17:32,531
まあ確かに頭に、頭にさー
Well, true, having a...

272
00:17:32,681 --> 00:17:35,831
あの紙飛行機ぶつかったらびっくりしちゃうもんね。
having a paper airplane hit you in the head would startle you.

273
00:17:36,931 --> 00:17:40,281
どこ狙えばよかったの？手、見えなかったけどな。
Where was I supposed to aim? His hands weren't even visible.

274
00:17:41,031 --> 00:17:41,981
PSか？
Gamer skill?

275
00:17:42,031 --> 00:17:43,731
わしのプレイスキルの話か？
Is this just a critique of my gamer skills?

276
00:17:44,031 --> 00:17:47,031
[Title: 第16問]
[Title: Question 16]

277
00:17:45,131 --> 00:17:46,881
ズキューンってなったね。
It went straight through with a zap, didn't it?

278
00:17:47,831 --> 00:17:51,331
「今日は草野球の試合だ」うわ！や、野球ちょっと自信なし！
"Today's the sandlot baseball game." Whoa! B-Baseball, I have zero confidence!

279
00:17:52,031 --> 00:17:53,881
あ、服装ね。行くよ。
Ah, the outfit. Here goes.

280
00:17:54,031 --> 00:17:56,031
えー、あ、絶対違う。
Uh... ah, definitely not that!

281
00:17:58,481 --> 00:18:00,231
草野球ってどんな服装だ？
What kind of clothes do you wear for sandlot baseball?

282
00:18:00,431 --> 00:18:02,031
草野球ってジャー…あ、
Is sandlot baseball a tracksu—ah,

283
00:18:02,131 --> 00:18:03,681
草野球っぽいのあった！
Found something that looks like baseball!

284
00:18:04,231 --> 00:18:06,631
行くぞ、行くぞ！これ！
Here we go, here we go! This!

285
00:18:07,031 --> 00:18:08,831
で、これ！
And then this!

286
00:18:09,031 --> 00:18:09,781
あ、
Ah,

287
00:18:13,131 --> 00:18:14,181
いいんじゃない？
Isn't that good?

288
00:18:14,231 --> 00:18:16,531
いいんじゃない、かなり？かなりいいんじゃない？
Isn't that pretty good? Pretty darn good, right?

289
00:18:17,031 --> 00:18:20,031
[Title: 第17問]
[Title: Question 17]

290
00:18:17,131 --> 00:18:18,381
かなりいいんじゃない？
Isn't that great?

291
00:18:18,881 --> 00:18:20,381
上手、上手、上手。
Nicely, nicely done.

292
00:18:20,481 --> 00:18:21,881
上手じゃない、わし？
Aren't I good at this?

293
00:18:22,831 --> 00:18:23,631
おっと。
Oops.

294
00:18:24,031 --> 00:18:25,831
あ、え、やった、座ろ、座ろ。
Ah, yay, let's sit, let's sit.

295
00:18:26,681 --> 00:18:27,231
え？
Huh?

296
